Z||000011||RossT||02-01-2001||09:25 PM||||The "Fiero at Watkins Glen" is by Jack Stuart. Someone told me that they are hard to come by and worth some money.  When I bought my first fiero back in May of 99, I had paid the owner and was ready to leave, when he said, "oh I forgot something".  He went into the house, brought out the picture and said, "would you like this"?  I said yes! thank you very much!!! FREE!!||||reg||1
